presswork (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian release of Presswork, a memory-safe CUPS-compatible
    print spooler and IPP scheduler in Rust.
  * Bind cups.socket to loopback by default and harden cups.service with
    RuntimeDirectory, ProtectSystem=strict, and minimal capabilities.
  * Ship tmpfiles.d, sysusers.d, logrotate.d, and conffiles metadata.

